<title>UK: LB Rheinland-Pfalz sets 100 mln mark fix/rev FRN.</title>
<headline>LB Rheinland-Pfalz sets 100 mln mark fix/rev FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Morgan Stanley Bank AG, Frankfurt.</p>
<p> BORROWER   LANDESBANK RHEINLAND-PFALZ AG</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN DEM   COUPON    *8.50	MATURITY    26.MAR.07</p>
<p> TYPE   FIX/REV FRN   ISS PRICE  102.05    PAY DATE    26.MAR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.50	REOFFER    99.875    LISTING     FFURT</p>
<p> NOTES     *FOR FIRST TWO YEARS THEN (16 PCT - 2 X DEM LIBOR)</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  =	   DENOMS (K) ONE	 SALE LIMITS US/UK/DE</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   MGT/UND    0.325     SELL CONC   2.175</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF AN EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
